    "parent": {
      "kind": "core-rule",
      "id": "dice"
    },
    "summary": "For re-rolls:\n\n- A roll made by adding dice together, such as 2D6 or 3D6, is re-rolled in full.\n- No die can be re-rolled more than once.\n- Re-rolls come before any modifiers.\n- A re-rolled die is still a dice roll, so it can trigger anything a dice roll can.",
